06:08.290 --> 06:11.640
The one and only event made by Shinkis, for Shinkis!

06:11.640 --> 06:13.600
The Shinki-1 Grand Prix!

06:13.980 --> 06:16.890
I'm your host, Mary Takigawa Celes!

06:16.890 --> 06:21.360
And to help explain the rules, we have the tournament's committee head, the lovely Ia!

06:22.490 --> 06:24.480
It's a pleasure to be here.

06:24.480 --> 06:27.240
We have some truly delightful prizes in store this year.

06:27.560 --> 06:30.010
That we do! Talk about a grand prize!

06:30.010 --> 06:33.250
We've got a five-day, four-night trip to Okinawa for you and your master!

06:34.110 --> 06:35.310
I see!

06:35.310 --> 06:39.610
Lene's trying to show us up and give a present to Master!

06:40.590 --> 06:42.230
Two can play at that game...

06:48.960 --> 06:51.260
Lene and Ines are gone...

06:52.240 --> 06:53.440
Strarf too?

06:58.770 --> 07:00.770
Gone
 to
 work.

07:01.140 --> 07:02.220
Work?

07:10.320 --> 07:13.220
Think you can beat us in speed?

07:13.860 --> 07:18.060
Our magnificent driving skills shall grant us victory!

07:18.060 --> 07:22.280
You two are bike-model Shinkis, so why are you in karts?

07:22.280 --> 07:24.470
What's with the getup, Ines?

07:25.460 --> 07:28.340
I-I'm not Ines!

07:29.510 --> 07:33.770
I am but a nameless, masked Shinki who fights for her Master!

07:33.770 --> 07:35.530
Well, suit yourself.

07:35.530 --> 07:36.850
I've got this in the bag anyway.

07:37.360 --> 07:40.140
There's an Okinawa trip with Master on the line,

07:40.140 --> 07:42.400
so I'm gonna win this no matter what!

07:42.400 --> 07:44.270
Hmph! That's my line...

07:48.990 --> 07:50.920
I <i>won't</i> lose.

08:00.040 --> 08:03.670
And they're off! Every Shinki's crossing the starting line!

08:03.670 --> 08:08.840
Now then, Ms. Ia, give us the course overview one more time.

08:09.140 --> 08:10.240
Gladly!

08:10.240 --> 08:13.680
There are a number of checkpoints that all make a lap around the park,

08:13.680 --> 08:16.100
and following them all will bring you right back here!

08:16.100 --> 08:20.590
It doesn't matter if you take detours, as long as you pass the checkpoints!

08:27.240 --> 08:29.990
Ah! The racers have suddenly fallen into a pit hole!

08:29.990 --> 08:33.490
And where're the fuckers that pulled this shit?

08:33.990 --> 08:36.850
You've fallen for our trap, dummies!

08:36.850 --> 08:39.870
We'll be taking the prize in a doggy bag!

08:42.580 --> 08:44.710
Let's go, Mini Meowchines!

08:44.710 --> 08:47.340
And to top it it off, those machines are breaking the rules!

08:47.340 --> 08:48.840
Oh my, what a shocker!

08:49.500 --> 08:52.200
Such an ugly tactic...

08:52.200 --> 08:54.430
Let's do this fair and square!

08:54.950 --> 08:59.480
Wowzers! It looks like Ach and Yda are making a comeback in Trike mode!

09:00.880 --> 09:02.270
Well if that's how we're playing,

09:02.270 --> 09:05.230
it looks like the Tire form I prepared will come in handy!

09:06.390 --> 09:10.950
It looks like she's forcing a transformation out of her armor!

09:12.200 --> 09:13.700
I'm gonna puke...

09:13.700 --> 09:16.060
This race is coming apart at the seams!

09:16.060 --> 09:18.670
Got any commentary for us, Ms. Ia?

09:18.670 --> 09:20.640
There's not much we can do, right?

09:20.640 --> 09:22.950
So from here on, let's change the rules a bit.

09:22.950 --> 09:27.710
As long as you have tires, it's legal to ride!

09:28.800 --> 09:30.050
And there you have it.

09:31.470 --> 09:34.890
So move those asses, you fuckin' worms!

09:37.100 --> 09:40.370
Wait, hold up! You're going alone?

09:44.770 --> 09:46.520
<i>Shoot! The jig's up!</i>

09:48.810 --> 09:51.680
You can't give up, Masked Shinki!

09:51.680 --> 09:54.110
We can get through this together!

09:58.900 --> 10:00.950
