Ann, perfect timing!

11:12.800 --> 11:14.860
Lend me your armor, please!

11:22.200 --> 11:23.450
Here's a reward!

11:23.770 --> 11:25.370
I've got to get going!

11:29.890 --> 11:31.180
Um...

11:33.540 --> 11:39.930
Tamami and Potchi have reached the refueling station with a huge lead!

11:40.170 --> 11:43.310
Let's lap up all of these before the other rats get here!

11:44.260 --> 11:47.240
These are normal oil Jellycans.

11:47.240 --> 11:54.690
However, we prepared an extremely rare strawberry-flavored can just for today's race!

11:57.170 --> 11:59.510
I-I'm stuffed...

12:03.330 --> 12:07.370
Let's give 'em these special Jellycans as a present!

12:07.370 --> 12:10.930
She's switching the Jellycans with nitro-flavored cans!

12:10.930 --> 12:13.440
Is this legal, Ms. Ia?

12:13.440 --> 12:16.630
It livens up the race, so why not?

12:23.020 --> 12:26.270
Wait a moment, Ach! If you drink that...

12:31.140 --> 12:34.230
I'm goin' berserk!

12:39.030 --> 12:40.280
Ach!

12:43.420 --> 12:45.930
I must defeat this enemy of ours!

13:12.930 --> 13:15.530
Ach, what's wrong?

13:15.530 --> 13:18.440
My brakes got done in.

13:21.350 --> 13:23.990
That's perfect! You gotta lend me that umbrella!

13:25.240 --> 13:29.270
What's she planning to use an umbrella for, Ms. Ia?

13:31.570 --> 13:32.500
Color coordination?

13:52.530 --> 13:55.140
Well folks, when it rains, it pours!

13:55.140 --> 13:57.750
This puts our racers at a steep disadvantage!

13:57.750 --> 14:03.030
I don't care how caked in mud you fuckers get, just <i>race</i>!

14:18.490 --> 14:19.670
Shoot...

14:20.050 --> 14:22.370
I can't catch up like this...

14:31.790 --> 14:32.680
Ann!

14:32.980 --> 14:34.940
Hm? Ines?

14:36.340 --> 14:39.440
Great timing! Ann, lend me that leaf!

14:47.210 --> 14:48.080
Meanie.

14:50.180 --> 14:51.910
A leaf surfboard!

14:51.910 --> 14:54.080
Is <i>this</i> legal, Ms. Ia?

14:54.080 --> 14:58.670
It may not have wheels, but she's still riding it, so why not?

15:02.130 --> 15:05.090
Now, back to Tamami and Potchi at the head of the pack!

15:05.090 --> 15:08.300
They just cleared a 90 degree turn with ease!

15:08.300 --> 15:10.550
But Yda's gaining from behind!

15:10.550 --> 15:11.990
She's really dogging us!

15:11.990 --> 15:14.270
She won't claw her way up that easily!

15:24.740 --> 15:28.190
They're neck and neck!
 It's a dead heat, folks!

15:28.190 --> 15:31.450
Yda springs into first!

15:31.450 --> 15:34.350
Following behind are Ach and the joke rac—

15:34.350 --> 15:37.080
er, I mean Kurara, and they're catching up fast!

15:37.670 --> 15:39.960
The real battle begins now!

15:39.960 --> 15:43.590
Can you keep up with my speed?

15:44.730 --> 15:49.340
Ach's putting the pedal to the metal and catching up on the second place Tamami!

15:50.920 --> 15:52.470
You shouldn't get too <i>claws</i>...

15:55.720 --> 16:00.260
Oh, she meant to use the umbrella as an air brake!

16:01.630 --> 16:04.330
The joke racer got caught in a pile-up and blew out!

16:04.330 --> 16:06.440
That's feline retribution!

16:06.440 --> 16:10.450
Tamami and Potchi are gaining on Yda!

16:13.450 --> 16:15.250
Shoot! She's fast!

16:15.250 --> 16:17.500
Well, how's she gonna like <i>these</i> apples?

16:28.580 --> 16:30.760
You're not supposed to dodge them!

16:33.230 --> 16:35.180
Okinawa!

16:50.940 --> 16:53.400
Unbelievable! It's the Masked Shinki!

16:54.790 --> 16:58.750
See you at the finish line!

17:01.260 --> 17:02.250
Crap!

17:05.130 --> 17:08.240
We're finally at the race's last course, the battlefield!

17:08.240 --> 17:10.840
Will Lene hold on to her lead?

17:12.620 --> 17:15.350
It looks like Yda's back, and she's catching up!

17:15.690 --> 17:20.530
Or so it seems, but it's actually the Masked Shinki wearing Yda's armor!

17:20.530 --> 17:23.530
The one to give Master that Okinawa vacation...

17:23.530 --> 17:25.360
will be <i>me</i>!

17:25.360 --> 17:29.230
Oh my! But the final battle starts here,

17:29.230 --> 17:31.630
with the final obstacle of the race!

17:32.490 --> 17:34.160
Strarf?!

17:39.910 --> 17:44.000
Why? Are you trying to show us up too?

17:44.990 --> 17:45.720
Wrong.

17:45.720 --> 17:51.510
I was simply hired by the race's executive committee to act as a the final obstacle!

17:59.280 --> 18:01.560
C'mon, go easy on me!

18:01.900 --> 18:03.310
I'll hold her off!

18:03.310 --> 18:05.060
You go on ahead, Ines!

18:06.370 --> 18:08.060
Lene, you knew?

18:08.060 --> 18:10.070
Just hurry!

18:37.780 --> 18:38.300
Lene!

18:39.140 --> 18:39.990
Ines!

18:44.140 --> 18:46.930
I don't want to hear you say I owe you one.

18:51.740 --> 18:53.110
That's a Strarf model for you!

18:53.580 --> 18:57.000
She was definitely worth the huge asking price!

18:57.000 --> 19:02.160
Fight! Kill! Bathe in their blood!{Shinkis for the Shinki god!}

19:04.260 --> 19:05.160
Oh my!

19:06.590 --> 19:09.210
It's the joke racer, Kurara!

19:09.210 --> 19:10.470
You shittin' me?

19:10.470 --> 19:13.840
She's holding the steering wheel, so it just barely counts!

19:16.310 --> 19:20.660
This isn't even a race anymore! It's a marathon!

19:20.660 --> 19:25.470
The Shinki who's shaken off every ounce of misfortune in her way is running fiercely! Run!

19:25.470 --> 19:27.270
And...

19:27.270 --> 19:28.850
Goal!

19:44.520 --> 19:46.620
That was a total mess.

19:47.100 --> 19:50.810
And we were so close to getting Master that Okinawa vacation, too...

19:51.450 --> 19:53.500
It's quite a shame.

19:53.820 --> 19:56.130
What're you all smiles over?

19:56.130 --> 19:58.760
You didn't do a thing in the end.

19:59.450 --> 20:01.470
I apologize.

20:01.470 --> 20:04.700
But I didn't enter the race for Master's sake.

20:04.700 --> 20:07.020
I did it for this.

20:07.740 --> 20:09.640
Strawberry flavored... Jellycan?

20:09.640 --> 20:11.520
Strawberry flavored... Jellycan?

20:11.830 --> 20:17.780
They offered this as a reward for staying the course, so I thought I'd get one for you.

20:18.940 --> 20:20.780
Why?

20:21.570 --> 20:25.990
Well... because you love strawberry Jellycans.

20:26.850 --> 20:30.500
We used to split these in half and share them all the time.

20:31.680 --> 20:33.420
So I...

20:34.410 --> 20:35.350
Lene...

20:37.580 --> 20:40.680
<i>That's right, we used to split these in half between ourselves.</i>

20:41.510 --> 20:44.950
<i>But the half she gave me was always a little bigger...</i>

20:50.580 --> 20:51.760
Sis...

20:53.440 --> 20:54.690
Sister?

20:54.980 --> 20:56.660
No, I mean, Lene!

20:56.660 --> 20:59.340
It's not like we're real sisters...

21:00.990 --> 21:02.690
Morning...

21:03.280 --> 21:05.200
What's up with you three?

21:05.200 --> 21:07.270
Not a thing!

21:07.270 --> 21:09.480
Good morning, Master!

21:09.480 --> 21:13.330
Master, you slept in! It's already past noon!

21:13.330 --> 21:15.980
Hm? Hey, where's Ann?

21:15.980 --> 21:17.460
Master!

21:17.460 --> 21:19.080
Look at this!

