21:21.720 --> 21:24.220
Wh-Wha? Why?

21:26.030 --> 21:30.980
Well, I took the mini car Ines left behind, and just started trading up!

21:42.310 --> 21:45.890
Special prize, Okinawa vacation! You hit the jackpot!

21:45.890 --> 21:46.780
Yahoo!

21:47.140 --> 21:49.290
And that's how it happened!

21:50.400 --> 21:51.470
Ann...

21:52.770 --> 21:55.040
Hm? What's wrong?

21:55.490 --> 21:57.600
Nah, forget it.

22:19.980 --> 22:26.480
I stand here reflected in your eyes

22:26.480 --> 22:31.760
and make something of a foolish face

22:32.890 --> 22:39.350
Being more gentle than the wind and invincible like the clouds

22:39.350 --> 22:44.300
I want to protect you

22:45.410 --> 22:51.850
Here in the forest I am lost in

22:51.850 --> 22:57.550
I want to try finding a four-leaf clover

22:57.550 --> 23:04.710
The sun is guiding me

23:04.710 --> 23:10.430
towards the miracles of two stars together

23:10.430 --> 23:13.620
Even we are hurt on the way

23:13.620 --> 23:17.600
and ten years pass

23:17.600 --> 23:24.090
this future where I can be with you is what I choose

23:24.090 --> 23:25.800
We will walk on ahead

23:27.130 --> 23:30.720
and not miss the sun's sign

23:40.670 --> 23:43.820
Finally, summer vacation! I've waited forever to hit those Okinawan beaches!

23:43.820 --> 23:47.990
I hear there are Okinawa-candy flavored Jellycans there!

23:47.990 --> 23:50.000
Hold on, are we all waterproofed enough?

23:50.000 --> 23:51.780
Our standard water protection is fine.

23:51.780 --> 23:53.930
This is the ocean, so that's not gonna cut it!

23:53.930 --> 23:56.650
Don't worry, this is why we have Swimsuit Armor!

23:56.620 --> 24:09.630
Next time

