23:57.870 --> 23:59.290
The Seaside Swimsuit Armor.

23:59.290 --> 24:01.710
Hey Strarf, what kind of Swimsuit Armor will you wear?

24:01.710 --> 24:02.900
Ah, I...

24:02.900 --> 24:04.560
You're wearing <i>that</i>?

24:04.560 --> 24:07.080
Next time, Strarf wears a <i>revealing</i> seashell swimsuit!

24:07.080 --> 24:08.650
I absolutely will <i>not</i>!
